dy Calendra Lys de Norwyn\nEpitafio: “Sus manos sanaban, su juicio pesaba.”\n\nSir Baltras del Alba Eterna\nEpitafio: “En la luz juzgó. En la sombra, no dudó.”\n\nDame Ysmena de Corlanth\nEpitafio: “Donde otros dudaron, ella se adelantó.”\n\nSir Tavric el Implacable\nEpitafio: “Solo dobló la rodilla ante la ley.”\n\nDame Lucille Ferrant\nEpitafio: “Caminó por el filo del juicio.”\n\nSir Galvain Mornclad\nEpitafio: “Habló con su espada, respondió con su fe.”\n\nLady Mariel del Silencio\nCapa de las Juramentadas (permite lanzar silencio 1/día).\n\n---\n\nKobold tuerto: lider que hizo una alianza con humanos\nAntes del paso de montaña de valverde está la otra tibu.\n\n\n"}}]},{"id":"ntg_67d8e44ca7c72cc947e18fe27fe0ed07","order":1,"title":"","collapsed":false,"data":{"group-title":"","group-chevron":false},"items":[]}],"extras":[]},"legacy":{"sourceKey":"Skitrixx \"Stix Ernesto\" Koboldtanz","unmapped":{"exhaustionToggle":0,"acrobaticsMod":"DES","animalHandlingMod":"SAB","arcanaMod":"INT","athleticsMod":"FUE","deceptionMod":"CAR","historyMod":"INT","insightMod":"SAB","intimidationMod":"CAR","investigationMod":"INT","medicineMod":"SAB","natureMod":"INT","perceptionMod":"SAB","performanceMod":"CAR","persuasionMod":"CAR","religionMod":"INT","sleightofHandMod":"DES","stealthMod":"DES","survivalMod":"SAB","":1,"pb-1":1,"pb-2":0,"pb-3":0,"pb-4":0,"pb-5":1,"pb-6":0,"pb-7":1,"pb-8":0,"pb-9":0,"pb-10":0,"pb-11":0,"pb-12":2,"pb-13":0,"pb-14":1,"pb-15":0,"pb-16":2,"pb-17":2,"pb-18":0,"pb-19":0,"pb-20":1,"pb-21":0,"pb-22":1,"pb-23":0,"pb-24":0}},"metadata":{"createdAt":"2026-07-26T03:35:34.464Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-26T03:35:34.464Z","migratedFrom":"v1"}},"chr_31b5cf3abda27cf3910182c6e1a6f82e":{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"chr_31b5cf3abda27cf3910182c6e1a6f82e","revision":2,"name":"Varka","color":"#d4875f","identity":{"className":"Semielfa Bruja\n(Archihada - Ermitaña - [pacto])","level":9,"experience":48840,"alignment":"TN"},"abilities":{"strength":8,"dexterity":16,"constitution":16,"in